      "description": "Employment Opportunities - View Current Gustavus Adolphus College Job Openings | Employment It appears you have javascript disabled. Please enable javascript to get the full experience of gustavus.edu Skip to Main Content Skip to Footer In this Section Human Resources Employment at Gustavus Internal Resources Employment Verifications Hiring Policies Welcome New Employee President's Welcome Employment Resources New Employee Paperwork Benefits Benefit Enrollment TIAA Retirement Plan Health Insurance Nice Healthcare Health Savings Account Flexible Spending Accounts Dental Insurance Vision Insurance Life Insurance Retirement Planning Additional Benefits Holidays & Time Away Employee Assistance Program FAQs HR Happenings Employee Extras Wellness as a Community Compensation Meet the Office FAQs Job Openings Sign In Gustavus Adolphus College Make Your Life Count Gustavus Adolphus College Employment Opportunities View Current Gustavus Adolphus College Job Openings Home Human Resources Employment Current Academic Opportunities 5 Jobs Title Department Posted Date Instructor of the Practice (Finance) - Part Time Business and Economics Aug 18, 2026 Apply Assistant Professor (GIS and Global Health) Environment, Geography, and Earth Sciences Jun 29, 2026 Apply Assistant Professor (Statistics) Mathematics, Computer Science, and Statistics Jun 29, 2026 Apply Assistant Professor (Specialty Open) Nursing May 20, 2026 Apply Assistant Professor (Acting and Directing) Theatre and Dance Aug 7, 2026 Apply Current Staff Opportunities 14 Jobs Title Department Posted Date Gift Planner Advancement Jun 16, 2026 Apply Event Support Coordinator Auxiliary Services Aug 4, 2026 Apply Campus Safety/Security Officer (Overnights) Campus Safety Aug 31, 2026 Apply Administrative Assistant (Part-Time) Center for International and Cultural Education Aug 21, 2026 Apply International Education Coordinator Center for International and Cultural Education Sep 4, 2026 Apply Custodian Custodial and Support Services Jan 5, 2026 Apply Catering Supervisor Dining Service Jul 28, 2026 Apply Market Place Server Dining Service Aug 25, 2026 Apply Market Place Supervisor Dining Service May 27, 2026 Apply Assistant Director of Student Employment & Financial Services Financial Aid Aug 31, 2026 Apply Enterprise Data Integration Analyst Gustavus Technology Services Aug 6, 2026 Apply Windows Endpoint Systems Administrator Gustavus Technology Services Aug 28, 2026 Apply Creative Director & Senior Designer Marketing & Communication Jul 30, 2026 Apply Animal Facility & Lab Coordinator Psychology Jul 30, 2026 Apply Gustavus Adolphus College is an Equal Opportunity Employer. Employment decisions at Gustavus are based on merit, qualifications, and abilities. The College does not discriminate in employment opportunities or practices on the basis of race, color, creed, religion, age, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, marital status, disability, veteran status, status with regard to public assistance or other categories protected by law. All employees are responsible for supporting the concept of equal opportunity and affirmative action and assisting the College in meeting its objectives. Gustavus will make reasonable accommodations for qualified individuals with known disabilities unless doing so would result in an undue hardship. This policy governs all aspects of employment, including selection, job assignment, compensation, discipline, termination, and access to benefits and training. Any employee with questions or concerns about any type of discrimination in the workplace are encouraged to bring these issues to the attention of their immediate supervisor or the Office of Human Resources. Anyone found to be engaging in any type of unlawful discrimination will be subject to disciplinary action, up to, and including termination of employment. Should you have any questions regarding equal employment opportunity, please contact Human Resources, at humanresources@gustavus.edu or make arrangements with your local HR manager to review our EEO Policy during regular work hours, Monday through Friday. 800 West College Avenue Saint Peter, MN 56082 507-933-8000 © 2026 Gustavus Adolphus College Careers Feedback Privacy Statement Title IX"
